{
  "name": "Wariskan - Daily Reminder Cron",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "0 2 * * *"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "cron-daily-trigger",
      "name": "Daily Trigger (09:00 WIB)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [240, 300],
      "notes": "09:00 WIB = 02:00 UTC (WIB is UTC+7, no DST)"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "={{ $env.SCHEDULER_BASE_URL }}/run/reminder-creation",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "x-api-key",
              "value": "={{ $env.SCHEDULER_API_KEY }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "timeout": 60000,
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "fullResponse": true
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "http-create-reminders",
      "name": "Create Due Reminders",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4,
      "position": [460, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const res = $input.first().json;\nconst body = res.body ?? res;\n\nconsole.log('[Wariskan Cron] reminder-creation result:');\nconsole.log(JSON.stringify(body, null, 2));\n\nif (!body.success) {\n  throw new Error(`reminder-creation failed: ${body.error ?? 'unknown'}`);\n}\n\nreturn [{ json: { step: 'reminder-creation', ...body } }];"
      },
      "id": "log-creation-result",
      "name": "Log Creation Result",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [680, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "={{ $env.SCHEDULER_BASE_URL }}/run/debt-reminder",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "x-api-key",
              "value": "={{ $env.SCHEDULER_API_KEY }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "timeout": 120000,
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "fullResponse": true
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "http-send-reminders",
      "name": "Send Debt Reminders",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4,
      "position": [900, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const res = $input.first().json;\nconst body = res.body ?? res;\n\nconsole.log('[Wariskan Cron] debt-reminder result:');\nconsole.log(JSON.stringify(body, null, 2));\n\nif (!body.success) {\n  console.warn('[Wariskan Cron] debt-reminder reported failure — check scheduler logs');\n}\n\nconst summary = {\n  date: new Date().toISOString(),\n  remindersSent: body.processedCount ?? 0,\n  skipped: body.skippedCount ?? 0,\n  errors: body.errors?.length ?? 0,\n  durationMs: body.durationMs ?? null,\n};\n\nconsole.log('[Wariskan Cron] Daily reminder run complete:', JSON.stringify(summary));\nreturn [{ json: summary }];"
      },
      "id": "log-reminder-result",
      "name": "Log Reminder Result",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1120, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 📅 Wariskan — Daily Reminder Cron\n\nRuns every day at **09:00 WIB** (02:00 UTC).\n\n**Flow:**\n1. Create reminder rows for debts due tomorrow / today / overdue\n2. Send WhatsApp reminders for all pending rows\n\n**Env vars needed:**\n- `SCHEDULER_BASE_URL` — e.g. `http://localhost:3001`\n- `SCHEDULER_API_KEY` — optional, set in scheduler.js",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 360
      },
      "id": "sticky-daily-info",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [240, 80]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Daily Trigger (09:00 WIB)": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Create Due Reminders", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    },
    "Create Due Reminders": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Log Creation Result", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    },
    "Log Creation Result": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Send Debt Reminders", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    },
    "Send Debt Reminders": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Log Reminder Result", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    }
  },
  "active": false,
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1",
    "saveManualExecutions": true,
    "callerPolicy": "workflowsFromSameOwner",
    "errorWorkflow": ""
  },
  "tags": ["wariskan", "cron", "reminders"],
  "meta": {
    "templateCredsSetupCompleted": false
  }
}
